#prob[Find all the cyclic subgroups of $D_8 $ . Find a proper subgroup $D_8 $ that is not cyclic][

Note that $D_8 = {1,r,r^2,r^3,s, s r, s r^2, s r^3}$, the cyclic subgroups are 

$angle.l 1 angle.r = {1}$ \

$angle.l s angle.r = {1,s}$ since $s^2 = 1$ \

$angle.l s r angle.r = {1, s r}$ since $s r s r = s r r^(-1) s = s^2 = 1$

